Our journey through Latin America continues in Lima, Peru. 🇵🇪

We're seeing firsthand why developments across Latin America matter to Americans. Strong partnerships, shared values, and serious policy discussions help strengthen our hemisphere and advance prosperity for future generations.

@KevinRobertsTX is president of The Heritage Foundation.

