From Bogotá to Washington, the future of freedom and opportunity in the Americas is a story worth following.

We're in Colombia documenting a new chapter in the country's history and exploring what its reforms could mean for citizens, institutions, and the enduring partnership between our two nations. 🇨🇴🇺🇸

@KevinRobertsTX is president of The Heritage Foundation.

